B.HH=new A.ev("Portofolio Design","Welcome to my Portfolio Design, where creativity meets functionality! \ud83d\ude80 Here, you ll find a diverse collection of my design works, showcasing expertise in:\n\n\ud83c\udfa8 Mobile App Design - Intuitive and visually appealing UI/UX for seamless user experiences.\n\ud83d\udcbb Web Design - Modern, responsive, and interactive website designs tailored to user needs.\n\ud83d\udcf1 Mobile UI/UX - Aesthetic and user-friendly interfaces for iOS and Android apps.\n\ud83d\udd8b Logo & Branding - Unique and memorable logo designs that define brand identity.\n\nEach project reflects a passion for innovation, attention to detail, and a user-centric approach. Let's create something extraordinary! \u2728",null,null,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/14LA40XBGuHDnKBmEgm7prsIXOU0O5lSy/view?usp=drive_link","",null)
B.HI=new A.ev("Wise Eco App","Wise Eco App is an innovative and eco-friendly application designed to revolutionize waste management.\nBy integrating AI, real-time tracking, and a seamless point exchange system,\nthis app connects users and waste collectors (taskers) to create a more efficient and sustainable recycling ecosystem.\n\n Key Features for Users\n\u2705 Authentication - Secure login and access management.\n\ud83d\udcb0 Trade System - Convert collected points into real money.\n\ud83d\udccd Tracking System - Monitor taskers in real-time using maps.\n\ud83d\udd14 Real-time Notifications - Get updates on waste collection and transactions.\n\ud83d\udea8 Panic Button - Notify the system if the trash bin is full or empty.\n\ud83e\udd1d Partner Option (Waste Banks) - Collaborate with recycling centers.\n\ud83d\uddd1 Waste Categories - Classify waste for better recycling management.\n\ud83d\udcc6 Pickup Scheduling - Set schedules for waste collection.\n\ud83d\udcf0 News & Updates - Get the latest updates from partnered waste banks.\n\ud83e\udde0 AI-powered Assistance - Use AI for full app access and interactive Q&A via chat and voice.\n\ud83e\udd16 AI Waste Detection - Identify waste categories using TensorFlow-based AI.\n\nKey Features for Taskers\n\u2705 Authentication - Secure login for taskers.\n\ud83d\udccd Tracking System - Optimize routes with real-time tracking.\n\ud83d\uddd1 Waste Categories - Identify and sort waste efficiently.\n\ud83d\udcc6 Pickup Scheduling - View and manage waste collection schedules.\n\u26a1 AI Energy Analysis - Evaluate energy-saving impact from waste collection.\n\ud83e\udd16 AI Waste Detection - Use AI with TensorFlow to detect waste categories.\n\nWith Wise Eco App, managing waste has never been smarter.\nJoin us in making a cleaner and greener future! \ud83c\udf31\u267b\ufe0f\ud83d\ude80\n",null,null,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vPI1RLru_lqveMe01nQZz9ZPTKokj75H/view","assets/wise.png",null)
